WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.002 --> 00:00:03.003
Do you want to have sex?

00:00:03.003 --> 00:00:05.005
Love, I've just had a big dinner
and it's one in the morning.

00:00:05.005 --> 00:00:06.798
You still enjoy having sex with
me?

00:00:06.798 --> 00:00:08.133
Absolutely yes.

00:00:08.133 --> 00:00:09.635
As much as you used to?

00:00:10.552 --> 00:00:11.929
-Yes.
-Wow!

00:00:11.929 --> 00:00:14.598
I've seen the film before so I'm
not on the edge of my seat.

00:00:14.598 --> 00:00:16.767
But it's still my favorite of
all time.

00:00:19.144 --> 00:00:20.145
You don't have kids?

00:00:20.145 --> 00:00:22.147
We have actually been trying for
kids for a while now.

00:00:27.319 --> 00:00:31.406
With your complications,
conceiving is very unlikely.

00:00:32.032 --> 00:00:33.116
So what do we do now?

00:00:33.450 --> 00:00:37.329
A small piece of us dies and we
just carry on with whatever's
left.

00:00:37.746 --> 00:00:39.831
Alright, well as long as
we've got a plan.

00:00:42.084 --> 00:00:43.669
I think I'm ready to talk about
adopting.

00:00:44.294 --> 00:00:45.462
You gotta be careful with
adoption.

00:00:45.462 --> 00:00:48.590
Mel from the club got a rescue
dog, shat everywhere.

00:00:48.674 --> 00:00:50.384
I don't know what I'm supposed
to do with that information.

00:00:50.384 --> 00:00:52.552
(Music)

00:00:52.552 --> 00:00:54.096
We need to convince people
that we're great.

00:00:54.388 --> 00:00:55.389
And they're gonna judge us.

00:00:55.389 --> 00:00:57.474
(Music)

00:00:57.474 --> 00:01:00.352
We should make a list of all the
flaws that we wanna iron out.

00:01:00.352 --> 00:01:01.186
You drink too much.

00:01:01.186 --> 00:01:02.521
You should stop smoking.

00:01:02.521 --> 00:01:03.981
You need to get stronger
emotionally.

00:01:03.981 --> 00:01:05.607
You need to work on your anger.

00:01:07.150 --> 00:01:08.819
I think we're gonna be amazing
parents.

00:01:08.819 --> 00:01:09.820
(pop)

00:01:10.696 --> 00:01:13.031
It is not a test, I am on your
side.

00:01:13.031 --> 00:01:14.283
This is about preparing you for
panel.

00:01:14.283 --> 00:01:16.576
So, how often would you say you
have sex?

00:01:19.454 --> 00:01:20.455
It's a scary business.

00:01:20.455 --> 00:01:23.917
My kids are vampires that suck
every ounce of energy out of me

00:01:23.917 --> 00:01:26.128
until I'm nothing but an empty
carcass.

00:01:28.046 --> 00:01:29.172
Other than that you're alright?

00:01:29.423 --> 00:01:30.424
Yea.

00:01:30.424 --> 00:01:39.725
(Music)

00:01:39.725 --> 00:01:41.852
Change, it's a bit scary.

00:01:41.977 --> 00:01:45.063
But you can't get too attached
to what you think your life's
gonna be.

00:01:45.522 --> 00:01:46.523
Love you.

00:01:46.523 --> 00:01:47.524
I love you.

00:01:48.358 --> 00:01:49.359
Even like this?

00:01:49.568 --> 00:01:50.944
I love you more like that.

00:01:54.031 --> 00:01:55.240
Oh for God's sake.

00:01:56.033 --> 00:01:56.908
Do you know how lucky you are?

00:01:56.908 --> 00:02:00.454
They are tiny little miracles.
Your 17 twitter followers can
wait.

00:02:02.331 --> 00:02:04.541
Talk to your children!

00:02:05.000 --> 00:02:06.543
They're not my children!

00:02:06.543 --> 00:02:07.919
-So sorry.
-I'm calling the police.

00:02:08.128 --> 00:02:09.129
We can't get a criminal record.

00:02:09.129 --> 00:02:09.963
They won't give us a kid.

00:02:10.380 --> 00:02:13.508
Sorry mate, we're not bad people
it's just it's just very
complicated.

00:02:13.508 --> 00:02:20.182
(Music)

